  "id": "dataforcanada/d4c-datapkg-environment-climate-health",
  "title": "Data for Canada - Environment, Climate, and Health Data Packages",
  "description": "Time-series measurements from a network of low-cost environmental monitoring stations in Canada, capturing air quality metrics (PM1, PM2.5, PM10 particulate matter, particle size distributions, and gas concentrations) alongside meteorological conditions (temperature, pressure, humidity, light). Companion health assets record system telemetry (CPU load, memory, disk, WiFi signal, battery, clock sync) for each station, supporting quality-control filtering based on device operational status.",
  "keywords": [
    "air-quality",
    "particulate-matter",
    "environmental-monitoring",
    "sensor-network",
    "iot-sensors",
    "canada",
    "meteorology"
